Z||000001||Nashco||06-03-2001||12:14 AM||||I plan on going.  I go to school about half an hour south, so I will be driving.  I am hoping to bring some non-fieroites from school (we're all gear heads, we just have different preferences) to show them what I hope to have someday <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif">  I won't be in the show, just checking things out, learning, and looking for good ideas.  Hopefully it's sunny and everybody's cheery.  My favorite thing about the Fiero crowd is so many good folks; the VW crowd seems too have a lot of weirdos, hippies, and people who get stoned a lot and consider themselves hippies <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/wink.gif"><P>Bryce<BR>88 GT||||reg||1
